        "client_msg_id": "c3239495-b573-406d-867b-7fe45b87609c",
        "text": "OK, this is new info — I was unaware that Yahoo was picking up LA Times stories. Good to know for future interactions with them and I will mention this. The tagline was apparently added somewhere in that re-syndication process, so not by us. I also noticed that “was produced” was repeated in the first line, which is my bad (though a little more subtle).",
